WEBVTT

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:08.950
<i>Very good.</i>

00:00:08.950 --> 00:00:11.500
<i>No hemorrhaging or ischemia found.</i>

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:15.180
<i>No major change in red blood 
cells, white blood cells,</i>

00:00:15.180 --> 00:00:16.820
<i>or hematocrit.</i>

00:00:17.110 --> 00:00:19.990
But your pulse is a bit on the rapid side.

00:00:19.990 --> 00:00:23.110
<i>Are you under any stress, 
Minnie C. Tachibana?</i>

00:00:23.110 --> 00:00:24.370
Not especially.

00:00:24.780 --> 00:00:28.390
<i>Tired of all these physical exams?</i>

00:00:28.390 --> 00:00:29.690
No.

00:00:29.690 --> 00:00:32.810
My husband enjoyed physical exams, too.

00:00:32.810 --> 00:00:35.480
He said it was like being 
in an amusement park.

00:00:36.830 --> 00:00:38.330
Glad to hear it.

00:00:38.330 --> 00:00:39.680
Okay, next...

00:00:42.200 --> 00:00:43.420
One moment.

00:00:48.940 --> 00:00:50.570
<i>Let's finish another time.</i>

00:00:51.480 --> 00:00:53.530
<i>Kito-san wants to see you.</i>

00:00:54.060 --> 00:00:55.340
All right.

00:02:26.000 --> 00:02:31.000
<b>Cards</b>

00:02:39.120 --> 00:02:40.470
Is something wrong?

00:02:41.040 --> 00:02:41.980
No.

00:02:41.980 --> 00:02:44.470
Doesn't Mount Fuji look beautiful today?

00:02:44.470 --> 00:02:46.470
Oh... It does.

00:02:47.270 --> 00:02:49.970
It's just like the day I first came here.

00:02:51.220 --> 00:02:54.650
You know, to tell the truth, 
I was quite worried.

00:02:55.030 --> 00:02:58.730
When I heard a former US Marine Corps 
second lieutenant was coming,

00:02:58.730 --> 00:03:00.760
I expected someone scary...

00:03:01.970 --> 00:03:05.100
I'm glad it ended up being someone 
like you, Tachibana-san.

00:03:05.100 --> 00:03:07.910
Please feel free to call me "Minnie C."

00:03:07.910 --> 00:03:12.290
That's how my husband introduced 
me to his friends and family.

00:03:12.840 --> 00:03:14.230
I'll do that, then.

00:03:15.500 --> 00:03:18.420
You look wonderful in a kimono, Minnie C.

00:03:18.420 --> 00:03:20.810
Do you often visit Japan?

00:03:21.250 --> 00:03:22.050
No,

00:03:22.050 --> 00:03:26.390
I first saw Mount Fuji when I flew 
over it, on my honeymoon.

00:03:26.390 --> 00:03:28.720
My husband was so excited!

00:03:28.720 --> 00:03:29.640
Oh?

00:03:30.400 --> 00:03:33.810
He loved Japanese culture 
more than anything,

00:03:33.810 --> 00:03:37.760
so when I wear a kimono, 
I feel as if he's near me.

00:03:45.680 --> 00:03:47.100
Do you see it, darling?

00:03:47.620 --> 00:03:48.820
Isn't it beautiful?

00:03:55.800 --> 00:03:57.350
Here you go.

00:04:01.520 --> 00:04:03.060
This is good.

00:04:03.060 --> 00:04:04.150
I want more.

00:04:04.150 --> 00:04:05.680
I'll go buy some more.

00:04:06.220 --> 00:04:09.210
So your name is Sana-chan?

00:04:10.320 --> 00:04:13.840
Are you the lady who talked to 
me at the research facility?

00:04:13.840 --> 00:04:17.520
No, but we have met recently.

00:04:17.980 --> 00:04:19.410
You don't remember?

00:04:20.820 --> 00:04:22.080
Pardon me.

00:04:22.570 --> 00:04:24.370
I was asked to handle the pigs.

00:04:24.370 --> 00:04:25.530
Right, over here.

00:04:26.030 --> 00:04:28.220
What will they do with them?

00:04:28.620 --> 00:04:31.250
They'll be cared for at a special facility.

00:04:31.810 --> 00:04:34.300
The people will probably do a few tests,

00:04:34.300 --> 00:04:36.530
but they won't harm the pigs at all.

00:04:36.530 --> 00:04:37.330
Tests?

00:04:37.690 --> 00:04:38.480
Yes.

00:04:39.010 --> 00:04:42.550
They're very special pigs created 
by your power, after all.

00:04:42.970 --> 00:04:45.360
You know about me?

00:04:45.360 --> 00:04:46.140
Yes.

00:04:54.930 --> 00:04:57.170
Where did this pig come from?

00:04:57.170 --> 00:04:57.900
Huh?

00:04:58.420 --> 00:05:01.190
Well, it's alive, right?

00:05:01.580 --> 00:05:05.030
What would happen if I used 
my power to get rid of it?

00:05:07.340 --> 00:05:08.660
Do you want to do that?

00:05:08.660 --> 00:05:09.390
Huh?

00:05:19.950 --> 00:05:20.710
Yeah...

00:05:21.120 --> 00:05:24.860
You know those long cylinders 
we always use, right?

00:05:25.590 --> 00:05:27.800
Right, I'd like nine, if possible.

00:05:28.440 --> 00:05:29.820
Can we do that?

00:05:29.820 --> 00:05:33.320
Great, I'll send someone 
to get them now.

00:05:33.320 --> 00:05:34.580
Thanks.

00:05:35.350 --> 00:05:37.010
Cylinders? For the flowers?

00:05:37.010 --> 00:05:38.880
The things like vases?

00:05:38.880 --> 00:05:39.770
Yeah.

00:05:39.770 --> 00:05:41.860
Hey, Chinatsu! Ichiro!

00:05:41.860 --> 00:05:42.860
Yes?

00:05:43.280 --> 00:05:46.340
I never knew those were 
provided by the florist.

00:05:46.340 --> 00:05:49.340
I'm no expert, but can't you 
use something else?

00:05:49.700 --> 00:05:52.840
Everything's decided through 
advance discussion.

00:05:52.840 --> 00:05:55.110
I can't just change things like that.

00:05:55.110 --> 00:05:56.300
What's up?

00:05:57.070 --> 00:05:59.570
I need you to go to Sakaki-san's place

00:05:59.570 --> 00:06:01.720
in Kokubunji and pick up the stuff listed.

00:06:01.720 --> 00:06:02.660
Got it.

00:06:07.210 --> 00:06:09.030
Take care of them, okay?

00:06:09.030 --> 00:06:10.490
Just leave them to us.

00:06:16.180 --> 00:06:17.640
How's it going on your end?

00:06:17.640 --> 00:06:20.240
Sorry, I'm still analyzing.

00:06:20.240 --> 00:06:22.690
This ability-user has a complex signal.

00:06:23.340 --> 00:06:24.430
Sana-chan.

00:06:24.430 --> 00:06:25.190
Hmm?

00:06:25.190 --> 00:06:27.740
Her name is Sana-chan.

00:06:28.670 --> 00:06:29.480
Roger.

00:06:29.480 --> 00:06:32.160
I'll keep analyzing Sana-chan's pattern!

00:06:33.290 --> 00:06:36.580
When I see them like this, 
pigs are pretty cute.

00:06:36.580 --> 00:06:37.530
Huh?

00:06:37.530 --> 00:06:38.820
What's wrong?

00:06:38.820 --> 00:06:41.250
Didn't you see one that 
looked a bit different?

00:06:41.250 --> 00:06:42.960
Was there one like that?

00:06:43.380 --> 00:06:45.170
Wasn't there?

00:06:47.930 --> 00:06:50.370
I believe you have something 
to say to me.

00:06:50.370 --> 00:06:51.220
Well?

00:06:51.220 --> 00:06:54.780
Let's apologize together. 
Okay, Sana-chan?

00:06:56.700 --> 00:06:57.930
It wasn't on purpose.

00:06:59.630 --> 00:07:02.270
I didn't ask if it was on purpose!

00:07:02.270 --> 00:07:05.700
Shouldn't a simple apology 
come first? Huh?

00:07:05.700 --> 00:07:07.620
L-Listen, Grandpa...

00:07:07.620 --> 00:07:10.520
Sana-chan really didn't 
do it deliberately.

00:07:10.520 --> 00:07:12.140
I realize that!

00:07:12.890 --> 00:07:15.310
But whether she meant any harm,

00:07:15.310 --> 00:07:17.110
the fact is that she did this.

00:07:17.110 --> 00:07:20.870
I told you not to use weird 
powers anymore, right?

00:07:21.210 --> 00:07:24.860
One wrong move, and "sorry" 
isn't gonna cut it anymore!

00:07:24.860 --> 00:07:25.540
Bu—

00:07:25.540 --> 00:07:28.030
Can't you even keep a promise?

00:07:28.030 --> 00:07:28.550
Well?

00:07:29.070 --> 00:07:31.760
B-B-But...

00:07:31.760 --> 00:07:34.810
But it wasn't on purpose!

00:07:35.450 --> 00:07:38.740
I wanna go to the research 
facility for my...

00:07:38.740 --> 00:07:39.870
Hey, don't cry!

00:07:39.870 --> 00:07:41.640
Now, now, now, old man!

00:07:41.980 --> 00:07:44.160
Don't be so touchy all the time.

00:07:44.160 --> 00:07:46.480
And toward a little girl, at your age.

00:07:46.480 --> 00:07:47.320
Huh?

00:07:49.520 --> 00:07:53.270
Little girl, my name's Naito Ryu.

00:07:53.720 --> 00:07:56.370
I'm this scary old man's friend.

00:07:56.370 --> 00:07:59.040
Know what "Ryu" means? 
It means "dragon."

00:07:59.650 --> 00:08:01.030
Pretty cool, huh?

00:08:02.110 --> 00:08:03.550
Hey, I'm not done—

00:08:03.550 --> 00:08:04.940
Now, now, now...

00:08:05.460 --> 00:08:06.830
You know,

00:08:06.830 --> 00:08:11.400
I'm one of the guys who've been chasing 
the baddies who held you prisoner.

00:08:11.880 --> 00:08:13.590
I'm on your side!

00:08:14.750 --> 00:08:19.600
So it's also our job to make 
sure that you're kept safe.

00:08:19.600 --> 00:08:22.300
And on that note, I have a favor to ask.

00:08:22.660 --> 00:08:23.860
What?

00:08:23.860 --> 00:08:28.650
We can't know when those guys 
will try to take you away again.

00:08:28.990 --> 00:08:31.180
To be sure we always 
know where you are,

00:08:31.180 --> 00:08:33.070
I'd like you to wear a homing device.

00:08:33.820 --> 00:08:34.780
This thing.

00:08:36.760 --> 00:08:37.690
Don't like it?

00:08:37.690 --> 00:08:39.830
Then, how about this one?

00:08:42.660 --> 00:08:45.320
You don't seem like a bad person, so...

00:08:45.800 --> 00:08:46.450
Okay.

00:08:46.450 --> 00:08:48.710
I'll put it on for you.

00:08:48.710 --> 00:08:49.850
Hear that?

00:08:49.850 --> 00:08:51.990
I'm not a bad guy.

00:08:51.990 --> 00:08:54.070
She said the same about me.

00:08:54.070 --> 00:08:55.840
What, really?

00:08:58.550 --> 00:09:00.140
I guess she likes it.

00:09:00.480 --> 00:09:01.370
Yeah.

00:09:03.160 --> 00:09:04.650
It looks good on you.

00:09:07.760 --> 00:09:09.370
Sanae, I'm hungry!

00:09:09.370 --> 00:09:10.190
What?

00:09:10.190 --> 00:09:11.680
Already?

00:09:11.680 --> 00:09:13.910
Shall I send someone 
to buy something?

00:09:13.910 --> 00:09:15.030
Really?

00:09:15.030 --> 00:09:16.810
I want that juice from before.

00:09:16.810 --> 00:09:17.780
Very well.

00:09:17.780 --> 00:09:19.860
Good for you, Sana-chan!

00:09:19.860 --> 00:09:20.650
Yeah.

00:09:20.650 --> 00:09:21.890
You want some, too?

00:09:21.890 --> 00:09:23.750
Can I? Yay!

00:09:23.750 --> 00:09:25.170
Just a little bit, though.

00:09:25.170 --> 00:09:25.780
Okay!

00:09:33.980 --> 00:09:36.010
Oh, you're already there?

00:09:36.450 --> 00:09:38.590
Thank you for moving so fast.

00:09:39.180 --> 00:09:42.810
I'll transfer to the car for 
the mission and stand by.

00:09:43.250 --> 00:09:45.140
Ready for your order anytime.

00:09:45.470 --> 00:09:46.430
Roger.

00:09:46.430 --> 00:09:48.430
Wait just a bit longer.

00:09:48.430 --> 00:09:49.770
I'll talk to you soon.

00:10:00.670 --> 00:10:02.420
Oh? What's this?

00:10:09.860 --> 00:10:12.000
Is that lady coming here?

00:10:12.750 --> 00:10:14.430
You mean Minnie C?

00:10:14.430 --> 00:10:16.970
She'll be nearby, but I don't 
think she'll join us.

00:10:17.770 --> 00:10:18.610
Okay.

00:10:19.110 --> 00:10:20.180
I don't like her.

00:10:21.480 --> 00:10:23.020
But I think she's very nice.

00:10:23.020 --> 00:10:24.390
She's always smiling.

00:10:25.410 --> 00:10:27.300
Isn't smiling all the time

00:10:27.950 --> 00:10:30.190
the same as never smiling?

00:10:31.910 --> 00:10:34.070
You're very perceptive, Kureo.

00:10:35.740 --> 00:10:37.030
Ah, in Iraq?

00:10:38.480 --> 00:10:41.050
Yes, while defusing a bomb.

00:10:41.600 --> 00:10:43.320
And after her husband died,

00:10:43.320 --> 00:10:47.450
she suffered from insomnia and was 
on the verge of being discharged.

00:10:47.970 --> 00:10:49.380
But then,

00:10:49.380 --> 00:10:52.780
after dreaming that her husband's 
arms were embracing her,

00:10:52.780 --> 00:10:54.670
her condition immediately stabilized.

00:10:55.190 --> 00:10:57.870
And that's when she became 
a Dream of Alice?

00:10:57.870 --> 00:10:59.660
Precisely.

00:10:59.660 --> 00:11:02.550
In any case, she's an intriguing sample.

00:11:03.160 --> 00:11:07.410
There have been very few cases of 
a living being turning into a card.

00:11:08.890 --> 00:11:12.660
Even if it's only one part of that being.

00:11:28.870 --> 00:11:30.500
Listen, Minnie C.

00:11:32.020 --> 00:11:32.980
Yes?

00:11:34.290 --> 00:11:35.790
Don't laugh, okay?

00:11:36.510 --> 00:11:38.260
I wouldn't do that.

00:11:39.190 --> 00:11:44.220
I think I'm happier now than 
I've ever been in my life.

00:11:45.210 --> 00:11:47.680
Yes, I am, too.

00:12:04.740 --> 00:12:05.620
No.

00:12:06.620 --> 00:12:08.030
<i>This will sound silly.</i>

00:12:08.600 --> 00:12:12.830
<i>But I never feared death until I met you,</i>

00:12:13.320 --> 00:12:14.330
<i>Minnie C.</i>

00:12:23.250 --> 00:12:24.300
Darling...

00:12:26.890 --> 00:12:28.400
Yum!

00:12:29.480 --> 00:12:30.890
You have some on you.

00:12:31.550 --> 00:12:35.520
Watching you is making 
me hungry, Sana-chan!

00:12:36.610 --> 00:12:38.580
Thank you! These are for me?

00:12:38.580 --> 00:12:39.320
Yeah.

00:12:39.320 --> 00:12:40.590
You want any?

00:12:40.590 --> 00:12:42.030
I'm fine, thank you.

00:12:42.500 --> 00:12:43.760
Sana-chan?

00:12:44.360 --> 00:12:48.160
Are you interested in becoming a member of Zoroku-san's family?

00:12:48.160 --> 00:12:49.030
Huh?

00:12:55.830 --> 00:12:58.680
What the hell are you saying?!

00:12:58.960 --> 00:13:00.990
Now, now, now...

00:13:00.990 --> 00:13:04.390
I get it. You'd have to 
make arrangements!

00:13:04.390 --> 00:13:06.220
Like tableware and futons—

00:13:06.220 --> 00:13:08.210
That's not what I'm talking about!

00:13:08.210 --> 00:13:11.680
The agreement was to take her to a safe 
place, where she'd be cared for!

00:13:11.910 --> 00:13:14.330
Yeah, but just think about it...

00:13:14.330 --> 00:13:17.890
This is a kid who gets into car races 
with supernatural powers in town.

00:13:17.890 --> 00:13:19.750
Who else is gonna take her in?

00:13:19.750 --> 00:13:21.730
Just what do you think I am?!

00:13:21.730 --> 00:13:22.910
Briefly,

00:13:22.910 --> 00:13:26.220
I want her to have a good, 
responsible guardian.

00:13:26.220 --> 00:13:29.290
I'll personally arrange bodyguards 
and everything, of course.

00:13:29.290 --> 00:13:30.790
You'd damn well better!

00:13:31.190 --> 00:13:32.410
What I'm saying is—

00:13:32.410 --> 00:13:34.100
Besides, old man,

00:13:34.100 --> 00:13:36.410
what this girl needs is a family.

00:13:37.040 --> 00:13:41.490
A warm home, where she can eat 
good food and sleep safely.

00:13:41.490 --> 00:13:45.010
She's never known that kind 
of ordinary happiness.

00:13:45.010 --> 00:13:47.300
Ordinary happiness?

00:13:47.300 --> 00:13:49.150
That doesn't sound like you.

00:13:49.150 --> 00:13:51.640
When you talk about stuff like that,

00:13:51.640 --> 00:13:53.380
there's always an ulterior motive!

00:13:53.860 --> 00:13:55.050
I've gotta hand it to you.

00:13:55.050 --> 00:13:56.460
You know me well.

00:13:56.460 --> 00:13:58.630
Still, just do this for me...

00:13:58.630 --> 00:14:03.240
They want her to experience a normal 
lifestyle as soon as possible.

00:14:03.240 --> 00:14:04.270
Who does?

00:14:05.950 --> 00:14:08.860
Weren't you sort of considering 
this, anyway?

00:14:08.860 --> 00:14:12.010
That's how you are. I know you.

00:14:14.280 --> 00:14:15.780
Sana-chan...

00:14:15.780 --> 00:14:19.590
If you ended up living with us, 
what would you do?

00:14:19.590 --> 00:14:20.740
I don't know.

00:14:20.740 --> 00:14:22.380
What about you?

00:14:24.080 --> 00:14:25.670
Let's see...

00:14:25.670 --> 00:14:29.360
I think I'd be kind of happy!

00:14:30.420 --> 00:14:31.390
And you, Zoroku?

00:14:33.520 --> 00:14:36.450
Do you not want me in your house?

00:14:36.920 --> 00:14:39.600
Look, before we get to that,

00:14:39.600 --> 00:14:42.310
you still haven't said something 
important to me.

00:14:42.900 --> 00:14:46.280
I know there's something 
you want to say first.

00:14:50.090 --> 00:14:51.100
B-Bathroom!

00:14:51.100 --> 00:14:51.700
Huh?

00:14:52.050 --> 00:14:53.150
I-It's true.

00:14:53.150 --> 00:14:54.160
I gotta pee!

00:14:55.010 --> 00:14:57.260
You did drink a lot of juice.

00:14:57.260 --> 00:14:58.620
It's this way.

00:14:59.520 --> 00:15:01.560
Oh, wait, Sana-chan...

00:15:01.830 --> 00:15:04.610
Your hair will get in the way like that.

00:15:06.180 --> 00:15:08.220
Can you use the bathroom by yourself?

00:15:08.220 --> 00:15:09.680
Don't mock me!

00:15:09.680 --> 00:15:11.840
I can do anything.

00:15:13.840 --> 00:15:15.840
Okay, you're all set.

00:15:24.720 --> 00:15:26.770
If you would, Minnie C.

00:15:26.770 --> 00:15:27.730
Right.

00:15:27.930 --> 00:15:30.300
A member of Zoroku's family, huh?

00:15:30.300 --> 00:15:33.040
I'd live in that house, huh?

00:15:33.040 --> 00:15:35.140
What should I do?

00:15:36.010 --> 00:15:37.280
Oh, yeah.

00:15:37.280 --> 00:15:39.620
I'll apologize to Zoroku after this.

00:15:39.620 --> 00:15:41.510
Guess I have no choice!

00:15:41.920 --> 00:15:44.150
I guess I have no choice!

00:15:46.290 --> 00:15:48.740
Sana-chan, are you okay?

00:15:49.480 --> 00:15:50.790
Sana-chan?

00:15:51.650 --> 00:15:52.890
Sana-chan?

00:15:54.230 --> 00:15:55.210
Sana-chan?

00:15:55.210 --> 00:15:56.440
Sana-chan!

00:15:56.440 --> 00:15:57.250
<i>Senpai!</i>

00:15:57.760 --> 00:15:59.330
<i>The transmitter's moving!</i>

00:16:02.310 --> 00:16:03.630
Yamada, where is she?

00:16:03.630 --> 00:16:06.730
<i>Go 300 meters, turn right, 
and go another 500 meters!</i>

00:16:08.350 --> 00:16:09.730
What is this?

00:16:10.190 --> 00:16:11.350
<i>Naito-san!</i>

00:16:11.970 --> 00:16:12.780
Did you find her?

00:16:13.500 --> 00:16:14.410
They got us!

00:16:15.730 --> 00:16:18.020
They rewrote the toilet's location!

00:16:28.840 --> 00:16:31.640
When she's like this, she looks 
like an ordinary child.

00:16:34.760 --> 00:16:36.620
Well done, darling.

00:16:37.530 --> 00:16:39.300
Thanks for always being there.

00:16:43.750 --> 00:16:46.230
Ichijo-senpai, I have Sana-chan's signal!

00:16:46.230 --> 00:16:47.100
<i>You're sure?</i>

00:16:47.100 --> 00:16:48.010
Yes.

00:16:48.010 --> 00:16:49.160
It's really weak,

00:16:49.160 --> 00:16:50.910
but the pattern is a match.

00:16:50.910 --> 00:16:51.900
<i>Where?</i>

00:16:51.900 --> 00:16:52.980
I'm sorry.

00:16:52.980 --> 00:16:55.130
The system is still unstable,

00:16:55.130 --> 00:16:56.630
so I can't pinpoint it.

00:16:56.630 --> 00:16:59.030
The GPS was for this, but now...

00:17:02.330 --> 00:17:04.210
Senpai! Her signal's gone!

00:17:04.210 --> 00:17:05.840
Contact Naito-san.

00:17:05.840 --> 00:17:08.460
Check all area surveillance 
cameras at once!

00:17:08.460 --> 00:17:09.400
<i>Roger!</i>

00:17:18.350 --> 00:17:19.530
<i>What is this?</i>

00:17:19.530 --> 00:17:20.750
<i>What's going on?</i>

00:17:22.450 --> 00:17:25.140
Oh? You've already perked up,

00:17:25.140 --> 00:17:26.730
Red Queen?

00:17:27.900 --> 00:17:29.580
I'm shocked.

00:17:29.580 --> 00:17:32.600
We gave you enough to knock 
out an adult for half a day.

00:17:33.730 --> 00:17:36.400
Just what kind of monster are you?

00:17:38.770 --> 00:17:41.170
Do you know who I am?

00:17:41.170 --> 00:17:43.390
I am Minnie C. Tachibana.

00:17:43.390 --> 00:17:46.330
I've come from the research 
facility to collect you.

00:17:51.590 --> 00:17:53.030
<i>What is this?</i>

00:17:53.030 --> 00:17:54.230
<i>What's happening?</i>

00:17:54.230 --> 00:17:55.380
<i>I can't move!</i>

00:17:55.850 --> 00:18:00.110
Being restrained by so much strength 
that you cannot move at all

00:18:00.110 --> 00:18:02.720
is a bit exciting, isn't it?

00:18:03.010 --> 00:18:05.350
In the military, I had that experience.

00:18:07.110 --> 00:18:08.140
That won't work.

00:18:08.480 --> 00:18:09.920
Don't worry.

00:18:09.920 --> 00:18:12.070
If you just stay quiet,

00:18:12.070 --> 00:18:13.620
we will arrive soon.

00:18:14.060 --> 00:18:15.990
Let's go home together.

00:18:17.620 --> 00:18:19.210
Wonderland?

00:18:20.580 --> 00:18:21.660
Yes.

00:18:22.330 --> 00:18:24.370
I want to show it to you.

00:18:32.190 --> 00:18:34.430
Just what are the Dreams of Alice?

00:18:34.430 --> 00:18:37.510
Perhaps, rather than a 
gift from the heavens,

00:18:37.760 --> 00:18:43.420
they're actually an illness or a bug 
in the workings of this world.

00:18:44.640 --> 00:18:47.350
That's what some people say.

00:18:47.350 --> 00:18:49.190
What do you think?

00:18:49.800 --> 00:18:50.810
Who knows?

00:18:50.810 --> 00:18:53.620
To be honest, I don't think it matters.

00:18:53.620 --> 00:18:55.180
Even if they're demons,

00:18:55.180 --> 00:18:59.170
if they can be used for a purpose, 
it's human nature to do so.

00:18:59.170 --> 00:19:02.000
That is why I've come here.

00:19:02.940 --> 00:19:04.260
That's great...

00:19:04.260 --> 00:19:05.740
I feel the same.

00:19:11.250 --> 00:19:15.380
What I'm about to show you 
is a clue to those demons.

00:19:18.150 --> 00:19:19.840
Ten years ago,

00:19:20.470 --> 00:19:24.180
part of the facility underground 
was rewritten into a mess,

00:19:24.180 --> 00:19:27.620
and an impossibly huge space appeared.

00:19:29.650 --> 00:19:31.590
Is that a relay antenna?

00:19:31.590 --> 00:19:35.070
We tried releasing drones to 
observe the space inside.

00:19:35.560 --> 00:19:36.860
But it didn't work.

00:19:37.320 --> 00:19:41.610
Anything in here that she 
dislikes is destroyed.

00:19:42.590 --> 00:19:43.950
"She"?

00:19:43.950 --> 00:19:48.410
It seems that she won't 
harm humans, but...

00:19:49.250 --> 00:19:50.110
Hey!

00:19:50.110 --> 00:19:51.830
Where are you?

00:19:51.830 --> 00:19:53.670
I've brought a visitor.

00:19:53.670 --> 00:19:55.340
Turn on the light.

00:19:57.160 --> 00:19:59.370
I need your data in order

00:19:59.370 --> 00:20:02.380
to learn what she really is, Minnie C.

00:20:07.080 --> 00:20:09.140
We call her

00:20:09.140 --> 00:20:12.100
the Red Queen.

00:20:17.930 --> 00:20:20.170
This ridiculous spectacle

00:20:20.170 --> 00:20:24.870
is an inexhaustible collection of cards 
she's created from her Mirror Gate.

00:20:26.440 --> 00:20:29.200
But for Dreams of Alice, cards are...

00:20:29.200 --> 00:20:31.610
Yes, each only has one.

00:20:31.610 --> 00:20:35.200
And getting the power they 
want isn't guaranteed.

00:20:36.770 --> 00:20:39.110
But she is extraordinary.

00:20:39.800 --> 00:20:44.650
In this Wonderland, everything she 
wishes for becomes reality.

00:20:45.200 --> 00:20:47.250
Anything she can imagine

00:20:48.170 --> 00:20:50.030
can come true.

00:20:52.160 --> 00:20:55.470
If you could obtain this 
power for yourself,

00:20:55.470 --> 00:20:57.990
what would you wish for?

00:21:03.270 --> 00:21:04.550
I...

00:21:11.660 --> 00:21:14.750
I shall explain what's happening now.

00:21:15.050 --> 00:21:16.410
Currently,

00:21:16.410 --> 00:21:21.090
you're in a vehicle moving at 100 
kph, on a road you don't know.

00:21:21.320 --> 00:21:23.370
If you were thrown outside right now,

00:21:23.370 --> 00:21:27.820
you would either crash into the ground 
or another vehicle, and you'd die.

00:21:27.820 --> 00:21:31.150
And if I apply just a bit more strength,

00:21:31.150 --> 00:21:34.120
your neck will break, and you'll die.

00:21:36.030 --> 00:21:37.530
Do you understand?

00:21:37.530 --> 00:21:39.400
Did you just imagine it now?

00:21:39.400 --> 00:21:42.690
If you struggle or disobey me,

00:21:43.310 --> 00:21:44.880
you will die.

00:21:46.210 --> 00:21:47.500
Understand?

00:21:48.840 --> 00:21:53.700
Until I met you, I'd never feared death,

00:21:54.350 --> 00:21:55.590
Minnie C.

00:21:56.550 --> 00:21:59.080
I would do absolutely anything

00:21:59.430 --> 00:22:01.420
to see him again,

00:22:03.220 --> 00:22:05.010
Red Queen.

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:40.020
Next Episode 
Something Not Human

00:23:36.480 --> 00:23:37.900
Something Not Human.
